fixedRewards.description:
The payouts the contract states itself (`ContractResult_Reward`) for success, as stored;
empty for the contracts that pay through a calculated reward, whose amount the Archive
does not state.

brand.description:
The brand from the same path: the second folder below `PU\Shops` (e.g. `tdd`, `mcraes`);
`null` for a container below `PU\loc`, one without a brand folder, or when the containers
disagree.

position.description:
The position `[x, y, z]` in metres in the frame of the system container, the position of
each Child composed with the positions and the full rotations of the Children above it;
`null` when no system container places the object.
